<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Ciena at top of range at $23. [CORRECTED 19:10 GMT]</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Ciena at top of range at $23. [CORRECTED 19:10 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			   Ciena Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $23</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $22 - $23</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			4,000,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		 Goldman, Sachs</p>
<p>NOTE: Four million shares were offered in the United States and one million shares were offered internationally for a total of five million shares (corrects number of shares).</p>
<p>Underwriter also said the price range was raised to $22 - $23 from the proposed price range of $17 - $19 on the night of February 6.</p>
</text>
